EO 5435 Executive Orders
It is further ordered, pursuant to Public Resolution No. 85, approved June 12,
1930, that, subject to valid rights, the public lands in the above-described areas shall
be opened to entry under the homestead or desert-land laws by qualified ex-service
men for who«e service recognition is granted by such resolution, under the terms
and conditions of such resolution and the regulations issued thereunder, for a period
of 91 days, beginning with the 63d day from and after the date hereof, and thereafter
if unentered, to appropriation under any applicable public land law by the general
public.
Subsequent to this order, and prior to the date of restoration to general dispo-
sition as herein provided, no right may be acquired to said land by settlement in
advance of entry, or otherwise, except strictly in accordance herewith.

